{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":30.239999771118164,"text":"Five insurers. Pages of fine print. Are you actually covered? Are you overpaying? Meet Lowball, your personal insurance agent. It reads every policy, knows exactly what you're covered for, and watches the market and your life. Drive less? Got a raise? It notices. When you're overpaying, it calls and emails every insurer at once, using each offer to beat the next. Same coverage, $756 a year back in your pocket. Lowball, never overpay again.","words":[{"word":"Five","start":0.0,"end":0.5400000214576721},{"word":"insurers","start":0.5400000214576721,"end":0.9599999785423279},{"word":"Pages","start":1.899999976158142,"end":1.9199999570846558},{"word":"of","start":1.9199999570846558,"end":2.259999990463257},{"word":"fine","start":2.259999990463257,"end":2.5199999809265137},{"word":"print","start":2.5199999809265137,"end":2.799999952316284},{"word":"Are","start":3.299999952316284,"end":3.3399999141693115},{"word":"you","start":3.3399999141693115,"end":3.5399999618530273},{"word":"actually","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":4.059999942779541},{"word":"covered","start":4.059999942779541,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"Are","start":4.78000020980835,"end":4.900000095367432},{"word":"you","start":4.900000095367432,"end":5.139999866485596},{"word":"overpaying","start":5.139999866485596,"end":5.699999809265137},{"word":"Meet","start":6.21999979019165,"end":6.400000095367432},{"word":"Lowball","start":6.400000095367432,"end":6.820000171661377},{"word":"your","start":7.079999923706055,"end":7.380000114440918},{"word":"personal","start":7.380000114440918,"end":7.840000152587891},{"word":"insurance","start":7.840000152587891,"end":8.300000190734863},{"word":"agent","start":8.300000190734863,"end":8.619999885559082},{"word":"It","start":9.079999923706055,"end":9.100000381469727},{"word":"reads","start":9.100000381469727,"end":9.279999732971191},{"word":"every","start":9.279999732971191,"end":9.7799997329